## 6. The design system

### 6.1 Tokens

The poster is the source of truth. `src/theme/tokens.ts` becomes the single definition and `src/theme/global.css` is generated from it (a small script, `scripts/gen-theme-css.mjs`, writes the `:root` block so the two can never drift). No other file holds a hex value.

